      "visible_text_excerpt": "New Arrivals\nIN THE SPOTLIGHT\nBeauty Just Got Smarter\nVIRTUAL BEAUTY TOOLS\n- hair care - thin hair How To Get Voluminous Hair: Our Best Tips and Products for Big Hair BY FERNANDA FARJEAT JUNE 22, 2026\nPROTECT & CORRECT WITH TRIPLE POWER\nTurn back the clock with our Triple Power Moisturizer with SPF 30. This daily moisturizer combines three powerhouse ingredients \u2013 Pro-Retinol, Hyaluronic Acid, and Vitamin C \u2013 to visibly reduce wrinkles and neck crepiness, firm your face and jawline, and brighten your skin. Plus, it includes SPF 30 to protect against 80% of skin aging caused by the sun.\nWOMEN OF WORTH\nSince 2005, L\u2019Or\u00e9al Paris has honored 210 Women of Worth uplifting their communities and transforming the world as we know it.\nJoin us in honoring the 2026 L\u2019Or\u00e9al Paris Women of Worth honoree class and help us continue to spotlight inspiring stories by nominating the next class of changemakers."
